{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "description": "runPanel contract evals. Each case scripts the local judges' verdicts via a deterministic llmCall stub; expected results assert the panel's contractual behavior. A case tagged known_bad MUST NOT yield final.pass=true; known_good MUST yield final.pass=true without escalation (unless the case says escalated). Fusion-strategy scope: v1 first-parse fusion is pinned only for garbage-skip (the first parseable verdict wins); weighted-fusion drift is out of corpus scope.",
